EmitJumpModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: EmitJump — Jump-block emission

    Function
        Name: EmitJump
        Params: state, b, term
        Returns: state

    DependsOn
        EmitInstrs, EmitBlock

    Reads
        b["instrs"], term["target"], state["labels"]

    Writes
        state["out"], state["labels"]

    Behavior
        Emits the block instructions, then either br with computed depth or recursive EmitBlock(target)

    Notes
        Matches the Jump handler in emit_block
